 *
 * Drop this file into src/test/java/ alongside AppoitmentMainPageTest.java.
 * It requires JUnit 5 and Mockito (already in pom.xml).
 *
 * Target coverage gaps:
 *  - bookAppointment: success path (slot available → INSERT → email sent)
 *  - bookAppointment: INSERT returns empty RS (no appointment_id)
 *  - bookAppointment: slot available but userEmail RS empty after booking
 *  - viewMyAppointments: no DB, empty, past/upcoming rows
 *  - modifyAppointment: no DB, not found, cancel (0), past slot, slot unavail, success, failed update
 *  - adminMenu: all 5 cases + default
